b_app":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/angular/angular/issues/comments/488429106","html_url":"https://github.com/angular/angular/issues/30226#issuecomment-488429106","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/angular/angular/issues/30226","id":488429106,"node_id":"MDEyOklzc3VlQ29tbWVudDQ4ODQyOTEwNg==","user":{"login":"spock123","id":1267316,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjEyNjczMTY=","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/1267316?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/spock123","html_url":"https://github.com/spock123","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/spock123/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/spock123/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/spock123/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/spock123/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/spock123/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/spock123/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/spock123/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/spock123/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/spock123/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2019-05-01T21:10:37Z","updated_at":"2019-05-01T21:12:14Z","body":"@JoostK I've found the error.\r\n\r\nMy app is internationalized using ngx-translate. I create a top path language element by manipulating the APP_BASE_HREF token when app module is initialized:\r\n\r\n```\r\n { provide: APP_BASE_HREF,\r\n      useValue: '/' + (window.location.pathname.split('/')[1] || '')\r\n    }\r\n\r\n```\r\n\r\nSo I have /da/....  /en/.....  as base href for multiple languages.\r\n\r\nBefore IVY this is ok but with IVY  it complains that window.location.pathname  is undefined.\r\n","author_association":"NONE","pin":null,"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/angular/angular/issues/comments/488429106/reactions","total_count":1,"+